{"3624140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wanderburg", "steam_appid": 3624140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5026240], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/ad9220c21de0995b0be0dcb4825c407c.poster.avif?t=1788282095\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/ad9220c21de0995b0be0dcb4825c407c.webm?t=1788282095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/ad9220c21de0995b0be0dcb4825c407c.mp4?t=1788282095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Castles weren’t built to move. Now they do.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wanderburg is a minimalist roguelike set in a medieval world of roaming fortresses. Castles hunt, Villages flee. And only the biggest stronghold survives. What begins as a modest moving fortress quickly becomes a growing, devouring war machine that reshapes the battlefield with every run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/9ee8a002038fb47b68c47a6168182349.avif?t=1788282095\" width=512 height=76 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/b31cd60780aefda929da52683c793b97.poster.avif?t=1788282095\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/b31cd60780aefda929da52683c793b97.webm?t=1788282095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/b31cd60780aefda929da52683c793b97.mp4?t=1788282095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roll forward and consume everything in your path. </strong>Fleeing villages, wandering flocks and smaller fortresses all feed your growth. Defeat powerful enemy castles to push your evolution further. Your castle does not just upgrade - it expands. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam-powered siege engines roll beside arcane artillery. Knights ride bicycles into battle. Massive strongholds fire broadsides like warships on land. And somewhere beyond the hills, something bigger is already on the move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/e26fc58ea12a3dadbc4fb82bb2545f82.avif?t=1788282095\" width=512 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/04d8280fb2b84b5cae65547e087a4613.poster.avif?t=1788282095\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/04d8280fb2b84b5cae65547e087a4613.webm?t=1788282095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/04d8280fb2b84b5cae65547e087a4613.mp4?t=1788282095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your modular arsenal piece by piece.</strong> Break the game while you're at it. Mount cannons, raise arcane towers staffed with wizards, deploy explosives, and experiment with wildly different builds each run. Between runs, unlock new modules and vehicles that open up fresh strategies and game-breaking combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A modular progression system lets you expand your moving fortress with new siege modules and structures, while unlockable vehicles, artifacts and captains between runs steadily widen your strategic options and build variety. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully playable with mouse, keyboard, or controller and highly optimized for almost anything you throw at it. </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/ad9220c21de0995b0be0dcb4825c407c.poster.avif?t=1788282095\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/ad9220c21de0995b0be0dcb4825c407c.webm?t=1788282095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/ad9220c21de0995b0be0dcb4825c407c.mp4?t=1788282095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Castles weren’t built to move. Now they do.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wanderburg is a minimalist roguelike set in a medieval world of roaming fortresses. Castles hunt, Villages flee. And only the biggest stronghold survives. What begins as a modest moving fortress quickly becomes a growing, devouring war machine that reshapes the battlefield with every run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/9ee8a002038fb47b68c47a6168182349.avif?t=1788282095\" width=512 height=76 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/b31cd60780aefda929da52683c793b97.poster.avif?t=1788282095\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/b31cd60780aefda929da52683c793b97.webm?t=1788282095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/b31cd60780aefda929da52683c793b97.mp4?t=1788282095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roll forward and consume everything in your path. </strong>Fleeing villages, wandering flocks and smaller fortresses all feed your growth. Defeat powerful enemy castles to push your evolution further. Your castle does not just upgrade - it expands. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam-powered siege engines roll beside arcane artillery. Knights ride bicycles into battle. Massive strongholds fire broadsides like warships on land. And somewhere beyond the hills, something bigger is already on the move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/e26fc58ea12a3dadbc4fb82bb2545f82.avif?t=1788282095\" width=512 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/04d8280fb2b84b5cae65547e087a4613.poster.avif?t=1788282095\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/04d8280fb2b84b5cae65547e087a4613.webm?t=1788282095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/04d8280fb2b84b5cae65547e087a4613.mp4?t=1788282095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your modular arsenal piece by piece.</strong> Break the game while you're at it. Mount cannons, raise arcane towers staffed with wizards, deploy explosives, and experiment with wildly different builds each run. Between runs, unlock new modules and vehicles that open up fresh strategies and game-breaking combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A modular progression system lets you expand your moving fortress with new siege modules and structures, while unlockable vehicles, artifacts and captains between runs steadily widen your strategic options and build variety. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully playable with mouse, keyboard, or controller and highly optimized for almost anything you throw at it. </p>", "short_description": "Drive your Castle on Wheels into battle in this minimalist medieval roguelike of roaming fortresses! Devour entire villages, build your modular arsenal of siege machinery and break the game as you grow with every stronghold you crush.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian", "reviews": "“Pump it into my veins!”<br>Eurogamer<br><br>“[...] straight on my Steam wishlist.”<br>GamesRadar+<br><br>“Just one more round, I swear.”<br>GameStar<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/a0a68815aac3899476a7365a04771e731008a406/header.jpg?t=1788282095", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/0d864e6de2382c4f55ebc023890617a49effccf2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788282095", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/0d864e6de2382c4f55ebc023890617a49effccf2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788282095", "website": "https://wanderburg.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 